    "id": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-1a2d4a0c24432e7ebd8475c5",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "属性断言：Consider the third-order system G_H(s)=6/(s^3+6s^2+11s+6)=1/(1+(11/6)s+s^2+(1/6)s^3). Using the second-order model G_L(s)=1/(1+d1 s+d2 s^2), we determine that ... Solving Equations (5.61) and (5.62) yields d1=1.615 and d2=0.624. The lower-order system transfer function is G_L(s)=1/(1+1.615s+0.624s^2)=1.60/(s^2+2.590s+1.60).",
    "aliases": [],
